# Four winds (Suufon Renda) when the 4th wind discard is also a riichi declaration
# (engine.md §4.1 row 2 vs row 3, §4.2, rules.md §5 item 9).
# Both rulesets accept Seat 3’s riichi before the abort. Seat 3 pays 1000
# (25000 - 1000 = 24000) and the table carries 0 + 1 = 1 stick.

[meta]
name: abort_suufon_renda_riichi_stick
title: Riichi on the fourth-wind discard pays its stick before the abort
rules: both
source: engine.md §4.1 row 2, §4.2, rules.md §5.9; real-log campaign, Docs/Evidence/real-logs.md

[round]
wind: E
round: 1
honba: 0
sticks: 0
dealer: 0
scores: 25000 25000 25000 25000

[wall]
hand 0: 1z 234m 678m 234p 678p
hand 1: 1z 123m 789m 123p 789p
hand 2: 1z 234s 678s 123s 789s
hand 3: 456m 456p 456s 56m 88p
dora: 7z
draws: 2z 3z 4z 1z

[steps]
0 discard 1z
window: 1=pass, 2=pass
1 discard 1z
2 discard 1z
3 riichi
3 tsumogiri 1z

